LovyanGFX
  The game draws through LovyanGFX 1.2.24, fetched at build time and linked into
  the firmware. Its library manifest declares MIT and BSD-2-Clause; see
  https://github.com/lovyan03/LovyanGFX for the license texts.
  Four of its bundled fonts are used (FreeSans 12pt, FreeSansBold 18pt and 24pt,
  FreeSerifBold 24pt). These are GNU FreeFont faces in the Adafruit GFX format,
  distributed under the GNU GPL with the FreeFont font-embedding exception.

