Hardware facts
  The pin assignments in x4_pins.h come from the Adafruit "CircuitPython on the
  Xteink X4" pinout guide, the FreeInk SDK board profile used by CrossPoint
  Reader, and the xteink-x4-sample sketch. The bezel inset in display.h is
  CrossPoint Reader's measurement. https://github.com/crosspoint-reader/crosspoint-reader

Artwork (img_*.h, x4_routes.h, assets/source)
  The illustrations were generated with OpenAI's image generation tool, then
  reduced to 1-bit and packed by the scripts in tools/assets. The maintainer makes
  no copyright claim over the generated images beyond what the law gives them.

Code and text
  Most of the code and in-game writing was produced with Claude Code (Anthropic)
